OL,3,ATwo arrested over major fire at
OL,4,AFolkestone hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a fire at a
OL,8,Fseaside hotel which led to hundreds of
OL,9,Fpeople being evacuated.
OL,11,FKent Police said a 38-year-old man and
OL,12,F21-year-old woman were held after the
OL,13,Fblaze at the Grand Burstin Hotel in
OL,14,FFolkestone on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe fire broke out at the hotel in
OL,17,FMarine Parade in the early hours and
OL,18,Fabout 280 people were evacuated from
OL,19,Fthe building.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
